  "content_html": "<p><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/b9abf373b8523bfd47.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"קשר עניבה - מה הקשר?\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"320\" src=\"/assets/images/content/b9abf373b8523bfd47.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תמונה טמונה</span></span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מצאו&nbsp; - בכל ציטוט - את המילה הקשורה לתמונה שלו:</span></span></p><div><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody><tr><td><img alt=\"דרגה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"40\" data-original-width=\"75\" src=\"/assets/images/content/04234c1cff64e6690d.png\" style=\"font-size: large; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" /></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\"><span style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">1) \"אַתֶּם נִצָּבִים הַיּוֹם כֻּלְּכֶם\"</span><br /><br /><br /></span></td></tr></tbody></table><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"/assets/images/content/24971a7763e76358ec.png\" style=\"clear: right; display: inline !important; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img alt=\"מפת אזור באיטליה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"600\" data-original-width=\"788\" height=\"244\" src=\"/assets/images/content/24971a7763e76358ec.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\"><span style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">2) \"כִּי אֶת אֲשֶׁר יֶשְׁנוֹ פֹּה\"</span><br /><br /><br /></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></span></span></div><div><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"כדור בייסבול\" border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/f8132c417d9f606261.webp\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" /></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">3) \"וְרָבְצָה בּוֹ כָּל הָאָלָה הַכְּתוּבָה בַּסֵּפֶר הַזֶּה\"</span><br /></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></span></span></div><p></p><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/b7821863adfa79412e.webp\" style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img alt=\"כוס בירה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"64\" data-original-width=\"64\" src=\"/assets/images/content/b7821863adfa79412e.webp\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">4) \"בְּאַף וּבְחֵמָה וּבְקֶצֶף גָּדוֹל\"</span><br /><br /></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/f6a89cb12b65590813.png\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img alt=\"דף תנועות חשבון בנק\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"322\" data-original-width=\"282\" height=\"200\" src=\"/assets/images/content/f6a89cb12b65590813.png\" width=\"175\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">5) \"וְשָׁב ה' אֱלֹהֶיךָ אֶת שְׁבוּתְךָ\"</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><br /></div></div><div>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">&nbsp;</span></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #212121; font-family: arial; font-size: large; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">תשבץ מדרג-אות</span></h2><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 ממיני העופות הטורפים</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שם מִדְבָּר המוזכר בתורה</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 פרוסת לחם דקה וקלויה</span></spa